        "name": "SIMRS Backend - Auth, Users, Polis & Doctors API",
        "description": "Postman Collection untuk endpoint Backend SIMRS Yii2:\n- Auth (/login)\n- Users (/users)\n- Polis (/polis & /api/polis)\n- Doctors (/doctors & /api/doctors)",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
